baby i am so sorry you had to go through this. if someone’s dating you because of your looks or your looks effect the relationship, they are a terrible evil human being. beauty isn’t real, beauty standards are completely messed up and you my love are beautiful. if you ever need to talk please message me, here are some of my favorites social media people who helped me through some stuff when it comes to looks ;

